# ── Mists of Pandaria Classic TOC ──────────────────────────────────────
# Interface 50504 = Mists of Pandaria Classic (per Warcraft Wiki current-
# interface table). Matched by MoP Classic clients ahead of the generic
# ToonAge.toc fallback.
#
# A trimmed LEVELING companion (navigation/guide + character + gear), not the
# full retail endgame set. Uses the SHARED Core engine and SHARED Utils/ErrorLog
# unchanged — MoP modules need no flavor-specific utils extension (unlike TBC).
# Lists NO Data/Retail/ and NO Data/TBC/ file; the mists profile
# (Core/Profile.lua) is the runtime backstop, this TOC the packaging backstop.
# StatEngine.lua (retail DR) and Layout.lua/TBCStats (TBC) are intentionally
# absent.

# ── Libraries ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Libs\LibStub.lua

